==Battleground==
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns after 46 seconds<sup>1,380f</sup>.
*1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[E. Honda (Enemy)|E. Honda]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
**5 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. E. Honda is only at 12% magnification and the peons only 150%.

